# What codebase-memory-mcp must not index.
#
# It reads .gitignore itself, nested ones included. Named here is what costs
# most to miss, so that it does not depend on .gitignore staying as it is.

# Nested checkouts of this repository: in the graph they would be duplicates
# of every class. The built-in safety core covers .worktrees and
# .claude-worktrees, but not .claude/worktrees, which the harness uses.
/.claude/worktrees/

# Build output: Gradle, Android, Kotlin incremental.
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/

# Orchestrator evidence (screenshots, logs) and assembled APKs.
/orchestrator/evidence/
/.build-outputs/
